   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is the provision of Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance (MPCA) to address the most urgent needs of drought-affected communities in Kenya. This IOM project provides multi-purpose cash assistance to a total of 20,878 individuals (10,342 males and 10,536 females) and 459 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
